# Silicon in the dense engine, small enough to explore in a browser tab.
#
# The explorer (viv-lang.org/explore) runs this in debug mode and records
# every step. It is dft/si.viv's deck at a lower cutoff (5 Ha, not 10), on
# the smallest shifted k-mesh (NKMESH 1, which leaves 4 k-points, not 2) and
# with 6 points per band-path segment (not 30), so the whole run takes
# seconds in the interpreter. The numbers it prints are not the converged silicon numbers
# that dft/si_check.viv tests; they are what the same code gives at these
# settings.
import dft.si
ECUT = 5.0
NKMESH = 1.0
NSEG = 6.0
import dft.kmesh
import dft.pw_common
import dft.pwdft

